kainjow-mustache provides CMake targets:

    find_package(kainjow-mustache CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE kainjow_mustache)
    # or: kainjow_mustache::kainjow_mustache, kainjow::mustache, mustache::mustache

Or alternatively:

    find_package(mustache CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE mustache::mustache)
